# Test Skill

Run tests from the `websocket-server/` directory. Never run from the repo root.

## Commands

| Mode | Command |
|------|---------|
| Unit + pg-mem (default) | `npm test` |
| With pattern | `npm test -- --testPathPattern="<pattern>"` |
| Integration (Docker required) | `npm run test:integration` |
| All | `npm run test:all` |
| Watch | `npm run test:watch` |

## Rules

- **Use a pattern when possible** — running all tests is slow
- **File naming:** `*.test.ts` for unit/pg-mem, `*.test.integration.ts` for integration. Never `*.integration.test.ts`.
- **Docker required for integration** — if not running, fall back to unit tests
- See `websocket-server/src/test/README.md` for stub policy and fixtures
